## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design real-world sagas with cross-service compensation and event sourcing.

## Key Concepts
- Orchestrated vs choreographed sagas
- Idempotency and replay-safe event logs
- Compensation mapping across services
- Read model consistency with CQRS

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: guard and dispatch a saga step
async function execStep(sagaId, step) {
  const key = `${sagaId}:${step}`;
  if (await seen(key)) return;
  await perform(step);
  logEvent({ sagaId, step, status: 'completed' });
}
```

